            "created_at": "2026-09-09T14:06:10.395623+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-luna-low-r2-b41",
            "text": "In the days before the Democratic Reform, the manor had included twenty-two smallholdings, six lots of grassland and farmland covering some 8600 Mu (1414.45 acres).",
